# Kimss Python SDK

When asked to integrate Kimss, follow docs/KIMSS_ONBOARDING.md.

- OpenAI drop-in: base_url https://api.kimss.ai/v1, api_key kimss_... (OPENAI_BASE_URL / OPENAI_API_KEY).
- Native KimssClient: base_url https://api.kimss.ai, X-Kimss-Key. Prefer client.agents.get(id).run(...) or client.agents.run(id, ...).
- Do not point Anthropic or Azure OpenAI official clients at api.kimss.ai inbound paths.
- Leave model payloads and tools unchanged unless requested.
- Kill switch code: agent_disabled. Positioning: Secure AI Gateway & Governance Control Plane. Never "zero-trust".
- Keys are kimss_..., never km_live_...
